## SMTP Setup Guide

To configure Gmail SMTP:
1. Enable **2-Step Verification** on your Google Account (`amira.coder03@gmail.com`).
2. Go to **Security** -> **App passwords** (or search "App passwords" in the settings search bar).
3. Create a new App Password (e.g. named "Portfolio Website").
4. Copy the generated 16-character password.
5. Create a `.env` file in the root directory and set:
   ```env
   SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
   SMTP_PORT=587
   SMTP_SECURE=false
   SMTP_USER=amira.coder03@gmail.com
   SMTP_PASS=xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx (your 16-character app password)
   SMTP_TO=amira.coder03@gmail.com
   ```

